(/usr/share/licenses/horae-livesync/LICENSE). The image also contains the
software below, each under its own licence. Checked against the pinned
LiveSync CLI image ghcr.io/vrtmrz/livesync-cli:1.0.46-patch2-cli
(sha256:4a0675db1ebd6d891624daedb37b1467f60de7b1a090f0252b7a1769fb382701),
built from vrtmrz/obsidian-livesync commit
